{"id":412,"title":"例子2: 时间复杂度评估","summary":"介绍嵌套循环计算时间复杂度","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5810cbb8-523e-4a79-b025-6c7c2441ffaa","text":"在上一课中，以一个简单的循环程序为例，通过总结所有基本操作来计算其时间复杂度。\n\n## 嵌套循环\n\n现在，我们将扩展前面的示例，并通过在程序中添加**嵌套循环**来使它更难一些。将继续按照与上一个示例中相同的步骤来计算其时间复杂度。 \n\n下面是一段简单的嵌套循环代码，用于打印`sum+=1`语句在整个程序中运行的次数：","text_html":"<p>在上一课中，以一个简单的循环程序为例，通过总结所有基本操作来计算其时间复杂度。</p>\n<h2>嵌套循环</h2>\n<p>现在，我们将扩展前面的示例，并通过在程序中添加<strong>嵌套循环</strong>来使它更难一些。将继续按照与上一个示例中相同的步骤来计算其时间复杂度。</p>\n<p>下面是一段简单的嵌套循环代码，用于打印<code>sum+=1</code>语句在整个程序中运行的次数：</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fa15a782-20ad-40cc-a500-fb532e591649","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 5  # 循环次数n*n\nsum = 0\nfor i in range(n):      # 第一层循环\n    for j in range(n):  # 第二层循环\n        sum += 1\n\nprint(sum)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f4c7e728-c2e7-4a6f-8fe7-ad1a593bbe56","text":"### 时间复杂度\n\n首先将上面程序分解成的单独操作：\n\n| 语句   | 执行次数    |\n| --- | --- |\n|  `n = 5`   |   1  |\n|  `sum = 0`   |   1  |\n|  `range(n)` **行 3**   |   $1$  |\n|  `i = 0`  |   1  |\n|  `i = 1`  |   1  |\n|  `i = 2`  |   1  |\n|  ...  |     |\n|  `i = n`  |   1  |\n|  `range(n)` **行 4**   |   $n \\times 1$  |\n|  `j = 0`  |   $1\\times n$  |\n|  `j = 1`  |   $1\\times n$  |\n|  `j = 2`  |   $1\\times n$  |\n|  ...  |     |\n|  `j = n`  |   $1\\times n$  |\n|   `sum+=1`  |   $(3n) \\times n$  |\n|   `Print(sum)`  |   1  |\n|  总计  |   $5n^2 + 2n + 3$ |\n\n> 我们将内循环的每个语句都乘以$n$，因为外循环运行$n$ 次\n>\n> 另外，请注意，虽然 `range(n)` 只执行一次，但它的执行成本是 $n$，即每次调用 `range(n)` 都会导致 `n`个单独的操作。\n\n$$$$\n$$\n\\text{Time Complexity} \n$$\n$$\n= 1 + 1 + n + (1 + 1 + 1 + ... + 1) + n \\times n + n(1 + 1 + 1 + ... + 1) + (3n) \\times n + 1\n$$\n$$\n\\Rightarrow 2 + n + n + n^2 + n^2 + 3n^2 + 1\n$$\n$$\n\\Rightarrow 5n^2 + 2n + 3\n$$\n\n\n## 小测试","text_html":"<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>首先将上面程序分解成的单独操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语句</th>\n<th>执行次数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n = 5</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sum = 0</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>range(n)</code> <strong>行 3</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i = 0</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i = 1</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i = 2</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>…</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i = n</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>range(n)</code> <strong>行 4</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\times 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>j = 0</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>j = 1</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>j = 2</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>…</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>j = n</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.72777em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sum+=1</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(3n) \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Print(sum)</code></td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总计</td>\n<td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5n^2 + 2n + 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.897438em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>我们将内循环的每个语句都乘以<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>，因为外循环运行<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span> 次</p>\n<p>另外，请注意，虽然 <code>range(n)</code> 只执行一次，但它的执行成本是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>，即每次调用 <code>range(n)</code> 都会导致 <code>n</code>个单独的操作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\"></annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Time Complexity} \n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.69444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8888799999999999em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"text mord displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"mord mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 1 + 1 + n + (1 + 1 + 1 + ... + 1) + n \\times n + n(1 + 1 + 1 + ... + 1) + (3n) \\times n + 1\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow 2 + n + n + n^2 + n^2 + 3n^2 + 1\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.9474379999999999em;vertical-align:-0.08333em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\